<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Tuesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			     3-mths	  6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 11.60 /11.475  11.85 /11.75   12.3 /12.25</p>
<p>BPI			 11.65 /11.45   12.00 /11.80   12.35 /12.20</p>
<p>Citibank		  11.525 /11.415 11.85 /11.725  12.25 /12.15</p>
<p>Metrobank		 11.60 /11.45   12.00 /11.75   12.5  /12.20</p>
<p>Multinational	   11.6 / 11.475  11.9  /11.75   12.25 /12.10</p>
<p>PNB			 11.55 /11.4    11.925/11.80  12.375 /12.2</p>
<p>Solidbank		 11.575/11.50   11.90 /11.825 12.275 /12.2</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
